{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"UTXO set changes of a block or date"},"description":"Bitcoin: What a block (`840000`) or a UTC day's published blocks (`YYYY-MM-DD`) changed in the UTXO set. Returns `{ first, last, hash, date, created, spent }`: `created` has one row per block, `spent` one row per creation height, each as columnar `height`, `count` and `supply` (BTC). The set after block `first - 1` plus `created` minus `spent` is the set after block `last`.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"Date":{"description":"Calendar date in YYYY-MM-DD format.","examples":["2009-01-03","2024-04-20"],"format":"date","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"Height":{"description":"A block height: how many blocks came before it.","examples":[0,210000,420000,840000],"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"point":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/Height"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/Date"}],"description":"Confirmed block height (`840000`) or UTC calendar day (`YYYY-MM-DD`)","type":["integer","string"]}},"required":["point"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_utxo_set_diff","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"Bitcoin":{"type":"number"},"BlockHash":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"Date":{"format":"date","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"Height":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"UtxoChanges":{"properties":{"count":{"items":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"height":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Height"},"type":"array"},"supply":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Bitcoin"},"type":"array"}},"required":["height","count","supply"],"type":"object"},"UtxoSetDiff":{"properties":{"created":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/UtxoChanges"}]},"date":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/Date"}]},"first":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/Height"}]},"hash":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/BlockHash"}]},"last":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/Height"}]},"spent":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/UtxoChanges"}]}},"required":["first","last","hash","date","created","spent"],"type":"object"}},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"created":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/UtxoChanges"}]},"date":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/Date"}]},"first":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/Height"}]},"hash":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/BlockHash"}]},"last":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/Height"}]},"spent":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/UtxoChanges"}]}},"required":["first","last","hash","date","created","spent"],"type":"object"},"title":"UTXO set changes of a block or date"}
